  ('966ea52b-bb60-51b2-a863-c69a9e3a3f11', '47139ef4-9c94-5d32-a05b-03686b39cf39', 'The goje is a traditional Hausa…', '["One- or two-string fiddle","Metal bell","Xylophone","Clay drum"]'::jsonb, 0, 4, 'It is played with a bow, often with a calabash body.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goje', 'live'),
