  ('65781629-692e-5099-9d03-3962197ecba6', '47139ef4-9c94-5d32-a05b-03686b39cf39', 'Prince Nico Mbarga''s 1976 highlife hit, one of Africa''s best-selling singles, is?', '["Sweet Mother","Joromi","Ijele","Osondi Owendi"]'::jsonb, 0, 5, 'Mbarga was of Nigerian-Cameroonian parentage.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sweet_Mother', 'live'),
