  ('8678ed2e-7104-5e81-b613-d8bfd0124ca5', '47139ef4-9c94-5d32-a05b-03686b39cf39', 'The spelling ''Afrobeats'' (with an s) was popularised around 2011 by which UK DJ?', '["DJ Abrantee","Tim Westwood","DJ Edu","DJ Spinall"]'::jsonb, 0, 5, 'The plural name covers a broader pop sound than Fela''s Afrobeat.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Afrobeats', 'live'),
