  ('984726ee-81bf-5a26-a12a-4f7f0765dd74', 'b7588822-cdfa-56d9-97ab-7b3ff22ebc14', 'What did Rashidi Yekini famously do after scoring Nigeria''s first World Cup goal in 1994?', '["Did a backflip","Ran to the coach","Held the net and wept with joy","Took off his boots"]'::jsonb, 2, 2, 'The image of him clutching the net is one of the World Cup''s most famous.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rashidi_Yekini', 'live'),
