  ('b43c3c6e-e788-513b-bdb9-804bcdb3011a', 'b7588822-cdfa-56d9-97ab-7b3ff22ebc14', 'In which year did Israel Adesanya first become UFC middleweight champion?', '["2019","2015","2017","2021"]'::jsonb, 0, 4, 'He knocked out Robert Whittaker in Melbourne.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Israel_Adesanya', 'live'),
