  ('e9de497d-6fdb-5a21-b033-f3b8a6e2126e', '4ce1015d-3027-50fa-9e9d-9221da41de75', 'The ancient walls of which city are among the largest earthworks ever built?', '["Benin City","Kano","Ile-Ife","Zaria"]'::jsonb, 0, 3, 'Most of the walls were destroyed in the 20th century.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walls_of_Benin', 'live'),
