  ('df3a97c0-8375-5ad7-91ff-56fd5eece98c', '211a4a9b-0b4a-557f-babf-a3510ad048a9', 'Which city was famous for its rusty brown roofs?', '["Enugu","Kano","Calabar","Ibadan"]'::jsonb, 3, 2, 'Ibadan is one of Nigeria''s largest cities by land area.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ibadan', 'live'),
