  ('919b9e9a-39a5-5f74-a9b7-402b2764da02', 'dc3ea6aa-2f43-51ab-ac95-33cd1210b7ef', '''Ugu'' is the Igbo name for which vegetable?', '["Jute leaves","Spinach","Fluted pumpkin leaves","Waterleaf"]'::jsonb, 2, 2, 'Its scientific name is Telfairia occidentalis.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telfairia_occidentalis', 'live'),
