  ('195c1460-de80-5be3-b001-ca8779a13289', '18161701-c98a-5a73-a7e9-079c46f8cb1d', 'Andela is known for training and placing which kind of professionals?', '["Nurses","Pilots","Chefs","Software developers"]'::jsonb, 3, 1, 'It started in Lagos in 2014.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andela', 'live'),
