  ('df27e925-cb39-543c-8b1c-5afb4195a81d', '18161701-c98a-5a73-a7e9-079c46f8cb1d', 'USSD codes like *737# are mostly used for what?', '["Calling the police","Booking flights","Checking the weather","Mobile banking"]'::jsonb, 3, 1, 'They work even without internet.', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unstructured_Supplementary_Service_Data', 'live'),
